pgwasm-postgres
===============

This repository carries changes to PostgreSQL as a patch series (`patches/`) and
files copied into the PostgreSQL tree (`overlay/`). Both derive from third-party
work, and these attributions are permanent. The licence text is in LICENSE.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PostgreSQL
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The patches apply to PostgreSQL at the release `upstream.json` pins. PostgreSQL's
own source is fetched when needed and is never stored in this repository.

  Source:  https://www.postgresql.org (https://github.com/postgres/postgres)
