------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ElectricSQL: postgres-pglite
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`patches/` and `overlay/` are derived from ElectricSQL's PostgreSQL 18.3 fork for
PGlite:

  Source:  https://github.com/electric-sql/postgres-pglite
           commit b133782cd759f08b3aeb263b80a963b39c7b7af1
  License: PostgreSQL License
  Copyright (c) ElectricSQL and contributors

The fork carries no licence file of its own: its COPYRIGHT file is PostgreSQL's,
unchanged, and PGlite's README (https://github.com/electric-sql/pglite) states:
"Changes to the Postgres source are licensed under the PostgreSQL License." The
fork's 22 commits on top of REL_18_3 were recut into five topic patches, each of
which names its source commit. The overlay started as the fork's files, copied
unchanged; since release 18.3.0 pgwasm-postgres changes and adds to it.

